WEIRDGLOOP EXCHANGE API
  https://api.weirdgloop.org/
  Grand Exchange price data is fetched from the WeirdGloop Exchange API,
  provided by Weird Gloop Ltd (the team behind the RuneScape Wiki).
  API documentation: https://runescape.wiki/w/RuneScape:Grand_Exchange_Market_Watch/Usage_and_APIs
  Used in accordance with their public API usage guidelines.

RS3 INTERACTIVE MAP
  https://mejrs.github.io/rs3/
  The embedded interactive world map is created by mejrs, using data
  extracted from the RuneScape game cache. Used via iframe embedding.

RUNESTATS.INFO
  https://runestats.info/
  Referenced as a player lookup tool. RuneStats pulls data from Jagex's
  official RS3 Hiscores API.

RUNEHQ
  https://www.runehq.com/
  Quest structure and reward data was cross-referenced with RuneHQ guides.

RUNESCAPE FANDOM WIKI
  https://runescape.fandom.com/
  Additional game data cross-referenced from the Fandom wiki.

